    "description": "<p>Ruby, a form of interlinear annotation, are short runs of text alongside the base text. They are typically used in East Asian documents to indicate pronunciation or to provide a short annotation.</p>\r\n<p>This specification revises and extends the markup model established by HTML to express ruby.</p>",
